(0) | score after: 0.41016 (+0.00026)\nv50 -> v51: Use updated v1.6 EEGNet checkpoints (new model files) for inference so the ensemble predictions improve. | change: Changed model_directory from 'raw_eeg_1d_eegnet_10000x19_v1.5' to 'raw_eeg_1d_eegnet_10000x19_v1.6' and swapped the five fold checkpoint filenames to updated versions (different kl_divergence suffixes). | score after: 0.41096 (-0.00080)\nv51 -> v52: Use newer/better EEGNet checkpoints, add horizontal flip augmentation and broaden TTA (add combined flips), plus small EEGNet code cleanup to improve inference performance. | change: Renamed self.relu to self.activation (cosmetic), reordered EEGNet __init__ arguments and simplified kernel iteration, swapped model_directory from v1.6→v1.7 and updated checkpoint filenames, added A.HorizontalFlip to transforms, and expanded TTA to i | score after: 0.42095 (-0.00999)\nv52 -> v53: Swap in updated ensemble checkpoints and refine preprocessing/transforms (add EKG-aware channel-difference handling and fix filtering), plus small model refactors to ensure correct forward behavior for inference. | change: Refactored module internals (renamed pooling/blocks variables and adjusted forward outputs), swapped model_directory and checkpoint filenames to a different EEGNet checkpoint set, added ekg flag to ChannelDifference and made it produce 18/19-channel  | score after: 0.42162 (-0.00068)\nv53 -> v54: Switch to a different set of EEGNet checkpoints, parameterize temporal dropout and instance-normalization behavior, and remove the (unused) spectrogram inference so the ensemble uses only raw EEG models. | change: Updated model_directory and model_file_names to a new checkpoint set; refactored InstanceNormalization1D (replaced log_scale/channel_wise with per_channel) and switched dropout transforms from hard-coded literals to values read from transform_paramet | score after: 0.41624 (+0.00538)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
