{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat history.md'","aggregated_output":"# Current version and earlier versions\n\nCurrent version: **v54**, leaderboard score 0.41624 (lower is better).\n\n## Earlier versions (oldest first; goal of the change, summary of the change, score the version reached)\n...(older versions omitted)\naveraged stacked predictions for submission. | change: Commented-out spectrogram model loading; added many new classes and functions including ResNet1DBlock and EEGNet (1D conv parallel kernels + ResNet blocks + GRU + ClassificationHead), and a load_eegnet_model loader that reads config.yaml and weights. | score after: n/a\nv36 -> v37: Fix the conditional that controls test-time augmentation averaging for raw EEG outputs so the correct flag (raw_eeg_tta) is used during inference. | change: Replaced condition 'if tta' with 'if raw_eeg_tta' before averaging raw_eeg_outputs, ensuring TTA averaging is governed by the raw_eeg_tta flag. | score after: 0.60627\nv37 -> v38: Fix inference bugs and improve robustness: preserve residual identity correctly, fix difference-feature shape, improve NaN handling via interpolation, and point inference to updated checkpoints. | change: Removed .detach().clone() on the residual identity in a model forward (keep reference), switched model directory and replaced the list of checkpoint filenames (using different saved epochs), changed difference-feature allocation from np.zeros_like(in | score after: 0.55564 (+0.05063)\nv38 -> v39: Switch to updated v1.2 EEGNet checkpoints (different epoch picks per fold) to improve ensemble inference performance. | change: Changed model_directory from 'raw_eeg_eegnet_10000x19_v1.0' to 'raw_eeg_eegnet_10000x19_v1.2' and replaced the list of per-fold model filenames (different epochs / checkpoints). | score after: n/a\nv39 -> v40: Fix/align the model implementation used for inference by removing the RNN branch, adjusting the classification head input size, and change activation to LeakyReLU (likely to match checkpoints or avoid a shape/compatibility bug and slightly adjust behavior). | change: Replaced ReLU with LeakyReLU; removed GRU definition and its forward usage (no RNN features concatenated anymore); changed ClassificationHead input_dimensions from 424 to 224. | score after: n/a\nv40 -> v41: Adjust the classification head input dimension to match the preceding feature map size (fix shape mismatch / improve compatibility and possibly performance). | change: Single-line change: ClassificationHead input_dimensions literal changed from 224 to 168. | score after: 0.54248\nv41 -> v42: Use updated model directory and newer/better per-fold checkpoints for inference (replace v1.2 checkpoints with v1.3 checkpoints) to improve ensemble predictions. | change: Updated model_directory from 'raw_eeg_eegnet_10000x19_v1.2' to 'raw_eeg_eegnet_10000x19_v1.3' and replaced the five fold checkpoint filenames with a new set of checkpoint files (different epochs and metric names). | score after: 0.46757 (+0.07491)\nv42 -> v43: Introduce EEG-specific preprocessing (bandpass filter) and temporal dropout augmentations and switch to updated EEGNet checkpoints to improve inference robustness / TTA performance. | change: Added scipy import and multiple new transform classes (SignalFilter, CenterTemporalDropout1D, NonCenterTemporalDropout1D and helpers), renamed some variables, updated model directory and checkpoint filenames (different epochs/checkpoints), and small  | score after: n/a\nv43 -> v44: Fix naming/consistency for 1D EEG inference pipeline (variable renames) and correct the prediction post-processing so outputs are aggregated and normalized correctly. | change: Renamed many raw_eeg variables to raw_eeg_1d_* (transforms, tta flag, task_type, inputs, outputs, prediction list), switched the model loop to raw_eeg_1d_eegnet_models, and corrected a bug in the multiclass branch that referenced the wrong variable ( | score after: n/a\nv44 -> v45: Fix/align DataFrame prediction column names and assign the correct 1D EEG prediction array so the submission uses the intended predictions. | change: Renamed raw prediction column list from '*_raw_eeg_prediction' to '*_raw_eeg_1d_prediction' and assigned df[...] = test_raw_eeg_1d_predictions (variable/column name alignment). | score after: n/a\nv45 -> v46: Fix the post-processing/submission step to use the 1D EEG prediction columns so normalized probabilities and the submission contain the intended predictions. | change: Replaced raw_eeg_prediction_columns with raw_eeg_1d_prediction_columns in normalize_probabilities call and in assignment to df_submission (two-line change). | score after: 0.46059\nv46 -> v47: Increase model capacity and adjust inference-time augmentation while loading a new set of pretrained checkpoints to try and improve inference performance. | change: Modified the EEGNet class (planes increased 24→128, ReLU→LeakyReLU, head input_dimensions 168→256, resnet blocks 9→11). Switched model_directory to a v1.3 checkpoint folder and replaced the list of model filenames (checkpoint swap). Tweaked temporal  | score after: 0.41674 (+0.04385)\nv47 -> v48: Refine the ResNet1DBlock implementation (conv/bias/dropout/order) and load updated v1.4 fold checkpoints to improve inference accuracy. | change: Changed ResNet1DBlock internals: added a second conv (conv2), changed conv1/conv2 bias settings, removed Dropout usage, reordered forward pass (conv1->bn1->relu->conv2->bn2->pool->add->relu), commented-out weight init, and slightly refactored block a | score after: 0.42174 (-0.00500)\nv48 -> v49: Fix a bug in the model forward pass (apply ReLU to the summed outputs) and switch to a different set of pretrained checkpoint files used for inference averaging. | change: Fixed forward() to apply ReLU to the combined 'outputs' tensor instead of 'x', removed commented-out initialization code, and replaced the five model checkpoint