normalization behavior, and remove the (unused) spectrogram inference so the ensemble uses only raw EEG models. | change: Updated model_directory and model_file_names to a new checkpoint set; refactored InstanceNormalization1D (replaced log_scale/channel_wise with per_channel) and switched dropout transforms from hard-coded literals to values read from transform_paramet | score after: 0.41624 (+0.00538)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
